<title>DENMARK: Landwirtschafliche increases bond to 350 mln DKK.</title>
<headline>Landwirtschafliche increases bond to 350 mln DKK.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Landwirtschafliche Rentenbank on Tuesday increased its earlier 250 million crown, four percent bond to 350 million crowns.</p>
<p>A statement from Dresdner Bank, which arranged the three-year loan, said that the paper was to be listed on the Copenhagen Stock Exchange on November 29.</p>
<p>--Ole Mikkelsen, Copenhagen newsroom +45 33969650</p>
</text>
